在监控指标结果下，直接复制指标进行查找定位，仅需修改"topic"里内容。
```

- kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_MeanRate
  - Topic 消息传输速率均值，可定位当前Topic平均处理多少消息
  - 每秒接收消息：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_MeanRate{name=\"MessagesInPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
  - 每秒失败的请求数量：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_MeanRate{name=\"FailedFetchRequestsPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
  - 每秒失败的生产数量：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_MeanRate{name=\"FailedProduceRequestsPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
- kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_OneMinuteRate
  - Topic 1分钟内传输消息速率，可定位最近1分钟有无数据
  - 每秒接收消息：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_OneMinuteRate{name=\"MessagesInPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
  - 每秒失败的请求数量：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_OneMinuteRate{name=\"FailedFetchRequestsPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
  - 每秒失败的生产数量：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_OneMinuteRate{name=\"FailedProduceRequestsPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
