  - 每秒失败的生产数量：kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_FiveMinuteRate{name=\"FailedProduceRequestsPerSec\",topic=\"CONNECTION-RECORD-LOG\",}
- kafka_server_BrokerTopicMetrics_FifteenMinuteRate
